    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent. She named a health care agent, a close friend from her relief work, and completed a health care proxy form; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. She said that what matters most to her is being useful to others and staying independent. She wants full treatment for reversible illness. She asked that her mental health history be shared with any future treating clinician so that her care can continue without a gap, and she agreed to keep a copy of her safety plan with her proxy form. She chose not to record other specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited yearly and before any future deployment. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
